Section 8:
  1: Plain file completion
    cat REA<tab> should complete to cat README.md
    cat vcpkg<tab> should complete to cat vcpkg.json or cat vcpkg-configuration.json
    cat you<tab> should complete to cat your_program.sh
    cat nonexist<tab> should not complete
    cat z<tab> should not complete
    cat x<tab> should not complete
    After tabbing, make sure cursor is set to correct position by following up with backspaces, further arguments, more typing, and more
  2: Nested completion
    cat src/Nav<tab> should complete to cat src/Navigation
    cat src/hist<tab> should complete to src/history.c
    cat /<tab> should complete to any file in root directory
    cat <tab> should complete to any file in current directory
    choose cat /Users/<username>/<prefix>
    cat /<space><space><space><tab>
  3: Matching directory name
    ls /ho<tab> should complete to ls /home/